# REPRODUCTION for bead inc-akac: an orc priest of Khasrach with the Pain
# domain (Feed upon Pain, ability level 1), fighting a summoned brown bear.
# Read with tools/check_feed_upon_pain.sh via logs/pain.log
# (INCURSION_PAIN_PROBE=1).
#
# DOMAIN LETTERS. Found by dumping the actual chargen screens: Khasrach's
# domain list (lib/religion.irh:2676) is laid out column-major, 3 columns.
# Picking 'a' then 'd' then 'a' gives Hatred, Pain, Destruction -- 'd' is
# Pain on the SECOND domain screen, once Hatred has already been removed
# from the list. This is a throwaway reproduction, not a regression
# fixture; if Khasrach's domain order in lib/religion.irh ever changes,
# redump the screens (add @dump lines back in) rather than guess new
# letters.
#
# WEAPON SWAP -> BRAWL. A priest of Khasrach starts wielding an orcish
# longspear two-handed (occupying BOTH Ready Hand and Weapon Hand). A
# longspear has reach (StateFlags & MS_HAS_REACH, tools/keys/
# bloodspear-regen-duration.keys documents the same rule): it can only
# strike a target TWO squares away, never one that is adjacent
# (src/Player.cpp:1335-1338, k stays at 2 while MS_REACH_ONLY holds). Once
# the summoned bear closes to melee range (one square), the longspear can
# no longer land a blow at all -- every RIGHT reads "You cannot move
# through the brown bear" and costs no game turn. The inventory sequence
# below moves the carried orcish heavy mace into Ready Hand one-handed;
# since the longspear was two-handed, this empties Weapon Hand, and
# AttackMode() returns S_BRAWL the instant that slot is empty
# (src/Creature.cpp:2750). Fighting bare-fisted has no reach requirement
# AND deals small, consistent damage (Punch 1d3+3, so 4-6 -- always <= 10,
# the RED case's threshold), which is exactly what this reproduction wants.
a
n
y
@choose "Orc"
@choose "Orc (Standard)"
@choose "Priest"
@choose "Khasrach"
a
@choose "Chaotic Evil"
a
d
a
a
a a
@while "|  *" RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT DOWN
ENTER y
y
a
a a a a

SPACE
@dump:played

# Swap the reach longspear for the one-handed heavy mace.
i
f
SPACE
a
SPACE
n
ESC
@dump:armed

d
@expect "Gender"
@dump:sheet
ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Animals"
@choose "brown bear"
RIGHT RIGHT ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
@dump:victim

s s s
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hurt

RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit1
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit2
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit3
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit4
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit5
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit6
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit7
RIGHT
@while "Take opportunity" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:hit8

@quit
